= [$] The state of systemd: 2026 edition
[Development] Posted Oct 9, 2026 14:58 UTC (Fri) by jzb
At the 2026 [25]All Systems Go! conference, systemd
maintainers Luca Boccassi and Zbigniew Jędrzejewski-Szmek
delivered the traditional "state of the project" session
with an overview of the systemd project's accomplishments
in the past year. That was followed by a maintainer round
table where Boccassi, Jędrzejewski-Szmek, Daan De Meyer,
and project leader Lennart Poettering fielded questions
about systemd's size, health, and if it might replace
Kubernetes. (It will not.)
