= Python 3.15 released
[Development] Posted Oct 9, 2026 17:15 UTC (Fri) by jzb
[61]Version 3.15 of the Python programming language has
been released. Notable changes in this release include the
addition of the sentinel and [62]frozendict built-in
types, the use of UTF-8 encoding by default, [63]package
start-up configuration files, as well as improvements in
the [64]experimental JIT compiler. See the "[65]What's new
in Python 3.15" article for an in-depth look at new
features in this release, and the [66]changelog for a full
list of changes.
